From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WebKitLegacy: reinstate the WebKit1 API iOS links

Upstream keeps this API but no longer builds it for iOS. UIKit imports about
eighty of its symbols by name and Mobile Safari drives the engine entirely
through it, so this builds it again for iOS: the DOM classes, WebView and
WebFrame, the iOS chrome client the substitution needs, default UIKit delegates
for every selector sent through the forwarder, and preference sync into
WebCore's settings.
---
